---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Job Creation | Phil Burney for Commissioner"
  description="Phil Burney's platform on job creation and economic development for Rutherford County District 5."
>
  <section class="section platform-hero">
    <h1>Job Creation</h1>
    <blockquote class="platform-quote">
      "Rutherford County has real strengths, but we face serious economic challenges. Our
      young people are leaving because too few opportunities exist here. Many small businesses
      never get off the ground or fail before truly blossoming because they lack affordable
      space and the support needed to succeed. That has to change."
    </blockquote>
    <a href="/platform" class="btn btn-outline back-link">← All Platform Issues</a>
  </section>

  <section class="section platform-stack">
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Partner with the Chamber of Commerce</h2>
      <p class="muted">
        Our local Chamber of Commerce is one of the most underutilized resources available
        to Rutherford County business owners. Phil will work to strengthen that partnership
        and make sure every small business owner knows what support is available to them.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Connect business owners to state and federal grant programs</li>
        <li>Provide access to business coaching and financial planning resources</li>
        <li>Reduce barriers to starting and growing a business in Rutherford County</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <h2>Revitalize Our Downtowns</h2>
      <p class="muted">
        Rutherford County has too many empty storefronts and deteriorating commercial
        buildings holding our downtowns back. Phil will work with our cities and towns to
        pursue funding that puts those properties back into productive use.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Pursue state and federal grants to buy and renovate vacant commercial properties</li>
        <li>Partner with local governments to identify priority buildings in each downtown</li>
        <li>Create move-in-ready spaces that lower the cost of starting a business</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <h2>Buy Rutherford Campaign</h2>
      <p class="muted">
        Too many residents don't know what Rutherford County has to offer. Phil will work
        with the Tourism Development Authority to launch a "Buy Rutherford" campaign that
        promotes our local restaurants, shops, and entertainment to the people who live
        here first.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Partner with the Tourism Development Authority on a resident-focused marketing effort</li>
        <li>Highlight local dining, entertainment, and retail across county platforms</li>
        <li>Drive foot traffic to downtown businesses and encourage locals to shop local</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <h2>The Rail Trail as an Economic Asset</h2>
      <p class="muted">
        Trail networks across the country have proven themselves as economic development
        tools - driving tourism, attracting businesses, and revitalizing the communities
        around them. The Thermal Belt Rail Trail is a real asset. The goal is to build
        on it, connect it, and fund it in ways that maximize its return for the county.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Work with Rutherfordton and other municipalities to connect trail segments into a larger, unified network</li>
        <li>Pursue state and federal grants to fund trail expansion, connectivity improvements, and amenities</li>
        <li>Partner with the Tourism Development Authority to market the trail as a regional destination</li>
        <li>Support trail-adjacent commercial development by ensuring surrounding corridors have water and sewer access</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="cta-inner">
      <h2>Help shape the agenda</h2>
      <p>Phil wants to hear from business owners and workers across District 5.</p>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a href="/donations" class="btn btn-primary">Support the Campaign</a>
        <a href="/platform" class="btn btn-outline-light">View All Issues</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
